    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Ai &amp; the Demon &amp; the Curse of Lust&quot; is an RPG game produced by \u5730\u8535\u30b5\u30d0\u30a4\u30d0\u30eb\u30ca\u30a4\u30c8 and published by Hanabi games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Content</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demon Communication\u2014a widely rumored urban legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After discussing it with her club friends, Ai returns home only to encounter the rumored demon. Through strange events, she unknowingly signs a contract and is cursed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, she must uncover the truth and defeat the mastermind in this thrilling RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jrpg</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Route selection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abundant CG content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captivating story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
